# Local runtime data (single-user document + event log, generated at
# runtime) — ignored BY FILE NAME so the bundled SOURCE data files
# (soft-skills taxonomy, matcher prompt) stay versioned (spec-002: a
# clean checkout must build — the blanket data/ rule previously hid the
# taxonomy from git and broke the Vercel build + fresh-checkout pytest).
**/data/events.log.jsonl
**/data/llm-requests.log.jsonl
**/data/resume.json
**/data/resume.json.bak

